(1, 'Intel Core i9 13th Gen', 'The ultimate heavyweight desktop processor. 24 cores and 32 threads performing at up to 5.8GHz.', 'The Intel Core i9-13900KF is a high-performance desktop processor from the 13th Generation Intel Core i9 lineup, based on the Raptor Lake architecture.\n\nDesigned for enthusiast gamers and serious creators, it features 24 cores (8 Performance-cores and 16 Efficient-cores) and 32 threads. With a Max Turbo Frequency of up to 5.8 GHz, it delivers blistering performance for demanding tasks.\n\nKey features include 36 MB of Intel Smart Cache, support for both DDR4 and DDR5 memory, and PCIe Gen 5 connectivity. The unlocked multiplier allows for easy overclocking, while the hybrid architecture intelligently assigns tasks for optimal efficiency.', 566.00, 100, 4, 'Intel', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-20 00:00:58', 0, '{\"Series\":\"Core i9 13th Gen\",\"Socket\":\"LGA 1700\",\"Cores\":\"24 (8P + 16E)\",\"Threads\":\"32\",\"Max Turbo Frequency\":\"5.80 GHz\",\"Cache\":\"36 MB Intel® Smart Cache\",\"TDP\":\"125W (Base) / 253W (Turbo)\",\"Memory Support\":\"DDR5 5600 MT/s / DDR4 3200 MT/s\"}'),
(2, 'MacBook Pro M3 14\"', 'The 14-inch MacBook Pro with M3 Pro. Mind-blowing performance and extended battery life.', 'The 14-inch MacBook Pro blasts forward with M3 Pro, a radically advanced chip that brings massive performance and incredible capabilities for demanding workflows.\n\nIt features a stunning 14.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display with 1000 nits sustained brightness and up to 120Hz ProMotion technology. With up to 18 hours of battery life, you can work all day.\n\nConnectivity includes three Thunderbolt 4 ports, an HDMI port, an SDXC card slot, a headphone jack, and a MagSafe 3 port. The Magic Keyboard comes with Touch ID for fast, easy, and secure authentication.', 2399.00, 96, 1, 'Apple', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Chip\":\"Apple M3 Pro\",\"CPU\":\"11-core or 12-core\",\"GPU\":\"14-core or 18-core\",\"Memory\":\"18GB Unified Memory\",\"Storage\":\"512GB SSD\",\"Display\":\"14.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR\",\"Battery\":\"Up to 18 hours\",\"Ports\":\"3x Thunderbolt 4, HDMI, SDXC, MagSafe 3\"}'),
(3, 'SAMSUNG Galaxy S24 Ultra', 'Galaxy S24 Ultra. The ultimate Galaxy experience, powered by AI and a titanium frame.', 'The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is the pinnacle of the Galaxy S series, featuring a durable titanium frame and a stunning 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display.\n\nPowered by the Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy, it delivers unparalleled performance. The versatile quad-camera system features a 200MP main sensor for crystal clear photos and a new 50MP 5x telephoto lens.\n\nGalaxy AI puts advanced features in your pocket, like Live Translate and Photo Assist. With a 5000 mAh battery and usage of the included S Pen, it is the ultimate productivity tool.', 1299.99, 99, 7, 'SAMSUNG', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Processor\":\"Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy\",\"RAM\":\"12GB\",\"Storage\":\"256GB / 512GB / 1TB\",\"Display\":\"6.8\\\" QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X\",\"Main Camera\":\"200MP Wide + 50MP 5x Zoom\",\"Battery\":\"5000 mAh\",\"Build\":\"Titanium Frame\"}'),
(4, 'Gigabyte GeForce RTX 4070', 'Prepare for stellar gaming and creating with the NVIDIA® GeForce RTX™ 4070.', 'The Gigabyte GeForce RTX 4070 is built with the ultra-efficient NVIDIA Ada Lovelace architecture. Experience fast ray tracing, AI-accelerated performance with DLSS 3, and new ways to create.\n\nIt features 12GB of G6X memory and the renowned WINDFORCE cooling system with alternate spinning fans for high efficiency heat dissipation. The metal backplate provides rigorous protection and structure.\n\nPerfect for 1440p gaming, it delivers high frame rates and stunning visuals in the latest AAA titles.', 699.00, 88, 4, 'Gigabyte', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Memory\":\"12 GB GDDR6X\",\"CUDA Cores\":\"5888\",\"Boost Clock\":\"2475 MHz\",\"Memory Bus\":\"192-bit\",\"Cooling\":\"WINDFORCE 3X\",\"Interface\":\"PCI-E 4.0\",\"Outputs\":\"3x DP 1.4, 1x HDMI 2.1\"}'),
(5, 'Logitech G502 Hero RGB', 'G502 HERO High Performance Gaming Mouse. Your favorite high-performance gaming mouse.', 'The Logitech G502 HERO features an advanced optical sensor for maximum tracking accuracy, customizable RGB lighting, custom game profiles, from 200 up to 25,600 DPI, and repositionable weights.\n\nHERO 25K is our most accurate gaming sensor ever with next-gen precision and ground-up architecture. With the fastest frame rate processing yet, HERO is capable of 400+ IPS across the 100 - 25,600 DPI range with zero smoothing, filtering or acceleration.\n\nUse Logitech G HUB to bad your commands and macros to each of the 11 buttons.', 79.99, 88, 3, 'Logitech', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Sensor\":\"HERO 25K\",\"DPI Range\":\"100 – 25,600 DPI\",\"Buttons\":\"11 Programmable Buttons\",\"Weight\":\"121 g (Tunable with 5x 3.6g weights)\",\"Lighting\":\"LIGHTSYNC RGB\",\"Report Rate\":\"1000 Hz (1ms)\"}'),
(6, 'Dell XPS 15 - 9510', 'Dell XPS 15. Premium craftsmanship with high-performance specs for creators.', 'The Dell XPS 15 9510 is a masterpiece of design and engineering. It features a precision-crafted aluminum chassis and a carbon fiber palm rest.\n\nPowered by an 11th Gen Intel Core i7 processor and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Ti graphics, it handles demanding creative workloads with ease. The 15.6-inch FHD+ InfinityEdge display provides immense screen real estate in a compact form factor.\n\nImmerse yourself in sound with the quad-speaker design and Waves MaxxAudio Pro.', 1099.00, 83, 1, 'Dell', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 23:43:03', 0, '{\"Processor\":\"Intel® Core™ i7-11800H\",\"Graphics\":\"NVIDIA® GeForce RTX™ 3050 Ti 4GB\",\"RAM\":\"16GB DDR4 3200MHz\",\"Storage\":\"512GB M.2 PCIe NVMe SSD\",\"Display\":\"15.6\\\" FHD+ (1920 x 1200) InfinityEdge\",\"Chassis\":\"CNC Machined Aluminum\"}'),
(7, 'Razer BlackShark V2', 'An ultra-lightweight esports headset featuring 50mm high-fidelity drivers and a noise-canceling mic for immersive, crystal-clear gaming performance.', 'Embrace the sound of esports with the Razer BlackShark V2 X—a triple threat of amazing audio, superior mic clarity, and supreme sound isolation.\n\nFeaturing Razer TriForce 50mm Drivers, we can custom tune high, mid, and low audio frequencies for a brighter sound. The HyperClear Cardioid Mic offers greater speech pickup and noise cancellation.\n\nAt just 240g, you\'ll barely remember you have it on during gaming marathons.', 1100.00, 78, 5, 'Razer', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-20 00:22:49', 0, '{\"Drivers\":\"Razer™ TriForce 50mm\",\"Mic\":\"HyperClear Cardioid Mic\",\"Surround\":\"7.1 Surround Sound\",\"Connection\":\"3.5 mm Jack\",\"Weight\":\"240 g\",\"Frequency Response\":\"12 Hz – 28 kHz\"}'),
(8, 'AMD Ryzen 7 5700G', 'AMD Ryzen™ 7 5700G. 8 Cores of Zen 3 Power with Integrated Graphics.', 'The AMD Ryzen 7 5700G is a desktop processor with 8 cores, launched in April 2021. It is part of the Ryzen 7 lineup, using the Zen 3 (Cezanne) architecture with Socket AM4.\n\nThanks to AMD Simultaneous Multithreading (SMT) the core-count is effectively doubled, to 16 threads. Ryzen 7 5700G has 16MB of L3 cache and operates at 3.8 GHz by default, but can boost up to 4.6 GHz, depending on the workload.\n\nThe processor is built on a 7 nm production process. With a TDP of 65 W, it consumes typical power levels. This processor features the Radeon Vega 8 integrated graphics solution for 1080p gaming without a discrete card.', 279.90, 98, 4, 'AMD', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Series\":\"Ryzen 7 5000 Series\",\"Microarchitecture\":\"Zen 3\",\"Cores\":\"8\",\"Threads\":\"16\",\"Base Clock\":\"3.8 GHz\",\"Max Boost Clock\":\"Up to 4.6 GHz\",\"L2 Cache\":\"4 MB\",\"L3 Cache\":\"16 MB\",\"TDP\":\"65W\",\"Socket\":\"AM4\",\"Integrated Graphics\":\"Radeon™ Graphics (8 Cores)\"}'),
(9, 'Corsair Vengeance LPX Series 16Go', 'Corsair Vengeance LPX. High-performance overclocking capability.', 'Vengeance LPX memory is high-performance memory designed for high-performance overclocking. The heatspreader is made of pure aluminum for faster heat dissipation, and the eight-layer PCB helps manage heat and provides superior overclocking headroom.\n\nOptimized for the latest Intel and AMD DDR4 motherboards, it offers higher frequencies, greater bandwidth, and lower power consumption. XMP 2.0 support ensures trouble-free automatic overclocking.', 49.99, 98, 4, 'Corsair', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Capacity\":\"16GB (2 x 8GB)\",\"Type\":\"DDR4\",\"Speed\":\"3200 MHz\",\"Latency\":\"CL16\",\"Voltage\":\"1.35V\",\"Heat Spreader\":\"Anodized Aluminum\",\"Color\":\"Black\"}'),
(10, 'MSI Optix AG321CR 32\" 165Hz', 'Visualize your victory with the MSI Optix AG321CR Curved Gaming Monitor.', 'The MSI Optix AG321CR features a 31.5-inch panel with a 1500R curvature, delivering the ultimate immersive gaming experience. With a 165Hz refresh rate and 1ms response time, it is built for competitive play.\n\nAMD FreeSync Premium technology eliminates screen tearing and choppy frame rates. The Night Vision feature brightens dark areas of the screen without overexposing the rest, ensuring you see enemies in the shadows.', 349.99, 100, 2, 'MSI', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Size\":\"31.5 Inch\",\"Panel\":\"VA (Curved 1500R)\",\"Resolution\":\"1920 x 1080 (FHD)\",\"Refresh Rate\":\"165 Hz\",\"Response Time\":\"1ms (MPRT)\",\"Color Gamut\":\"DCI-P3 94.55% / sRGB 120.25%\",\"Sync Tech\":\"AMD FreeSync Premium\"}'),
(11, 'Corsair Gaming K55 RGB', 'Corsair K55 RGB PRO. Dynamic lighting and 6 macro keys.', 'The Corsair K55 RGB PRO Gaming Keyboard lights up your desktop with vibrant five-zone dynamic RGB backlighting and powers up your gameplay with six easy-to-set-up dedicated macro keys.\n\nThe K55 RGB PRO is certified IP42 dust and spill-resistant to stand up to wear and tear. Quiet and responsive keys offer a comfortable feel during both work and play.\n\nDedicated volume and media keys let you control playback without interrupting your game.', 69.00, 98, 3, 'Corsair', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Switch Type\":\"Membrane (Rubber Dome)\",\"Backlighting\":\"5-Zone RGB\",\"Macro Keys\":\"6 Dedicated Keys\",\"Poll Rate\":\"1000 Hz\",\"Protection\":\"IP42 Dust and Water Resistant\",\"Connectivity\":\"Wired (USB 2.0)\",\"Palm Rest\":\"Detachable Soft Rubber\"}'),
(12, 'HP Victus 16', 'HP Victus 16. Built for play with a 144Hz display and OMEN Gaming Hub.', 'The HP Victus 16 Laptop is a massive beast of a machine. It features a 13th Gen Intel Core processor and modern NVIDIA graphics to handle all your favorite games.\n\nKeep cool and game longer with a cooling system that prevents overheating. The fast 144Hz FHD display ensures smooth gameplay with no lag.\n\nThe OMEN Gaming Hub is your one-stop shop to elevate your play. From rewarding your gaming to controlling every little performance and lighting option of your machine, the list goes on.', 1459.00, 98, 1, 'HP', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Processor\":\"Intel Core i7-13700H\",\"Graphics\":\"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB\",\"RAM\":\"16GB DDR5 5200MHz\",\"Storage\":\"512GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD\",\"Display\":\"16.1\\\" FHD 144Hz IPS\",\"Audio\":\"B&O Dual Speakers\",\"OS\":\"Windows 11 Home\"}'),
(13, 'MICROSOFT SURFACE LAPTOP 5', 'Surface Laptop 5. Multitasking speed meets stylish design.', 'The Microsoft Surface Laptop 5 with 12th Gen Intel Core processors delivers multitasking speed and all-day battery life in a sleek and stylish package.\n\nInteract naturally with the vibrant PixelSense touchscreen. The sleek, lightweight profile makes it easy to slip into your bag.\n\nLook and sound your best on calls with Studio Mics and enhanced camera experiences powered by Windows 11. Thunderbolt 4 connectivity allows for charging, data transfer, and 4K display output all from a single port.', 649.00, 97, 1, 'MICROSOFT', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Processor\":\"12th Gen Intel Core i7\",\"Display\":\"13.5\\\" PixelSense Touchscreen\",\"RAM\":\"16GB LPDDR5x\",\"Storage\":\"512GB SSD\",\"Battery\":\"Up to 18 hours\",\"Material\":\"Aluminum (Platinum)\",\"Ports\":\"Thunderbolt 4, Surface Connect\"}'),
(14, 'iPhone 15 Pro Max', 'iPhone 15 Pro Max. Forged in titanium. A17 Pro chip. 5x Telephoto.', 'iPhone 15 Pro Max is the first iPhone to feature an aerospace-grade titanium design, using the same alloy that spacecraft use for missions to Mars. It has one of the best strength-to-weight ratios of any metal, making this our lightest Pro model ever.\n\nThe A17 Pro chip brings a new class of pro performance and enables console-class gaming. The new USB-C connector with USB 3 speeds allows for huge data transfer leaps.\n\nCapture the highest quality photos and videos with the 48MP Main camera and the 5x Telephoto camera with the longest optical zoom of any iPhone ever.', 1199.00, 98, 7, 'Apple', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Chip\":\"A17 Pro (3nm)\",\"Display\":\"6.7\\\" Super Retina XDR (ProMotion)\",\"Material\":\"Titanium Frame\",\"Camera\":\"48MP Main | 12MP Ultra Wide | 12MP 5x Telephoto\",\"Storage\":\"256GB / 512GB / 1TB\",\"Connector\":\"USB-C (USB 3 Speeds)\",\"Action Button\":\"Customizable\"}'),
(15, 'SAMSUNG Galaxy Z Fold5', 'Galaxy Z Fold5. Unfold a world of possibilities with the largest Galaxy screen.', 'The Samsung Galaxy Z Fold5 is an immersive 7.6-inch screen in your pocket. The redesigned Flex Hinge makes it thinner, lighter, and more portable than ever with zero gap.\n\nUse Multi Window to blast through your to-do list with three apps on one screen. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy processor powers high-intensity gaming and multitasking.\n\nIt’s tough too, with Gorilla Glass Victus 2, Armor Aluminum frame, and IPX8 water resistance.', 1499.99, 100, 7, 'SAMSUNG', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Main Display\":\"7.6\\\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz\",\"Cover Display\":\"6.2\\\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz\",\"Processor\":\"Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy\",\"RAM\":\"12GB\",\"Stroage\":\"512GB\",\"Camera\":\"50MP Wide + 12MP Ultra + 10MP Tele\",\"Durability\":\"IPX8 Water Resistant\"}'),
(16, 'Google Pixel 8 Pro', 'Google Pixel 8 Pro. Power and pro-level photography, powered by Google AI.', 'The Google Pixel 8 Pro features the new Google Tensor G3 chip, custom-designed with Google AI for cutting-edge photo and video features and smarter ways to help throughout the day.\n\nThe 6.7-inch Super Actua display is our brightest ever. The fully upgraded camera system includes pro-level lenses for better low-light photos, sharper selfies, and the best zoom yet.\n\nWith 7 years of OS, security, and Feature Drop updates, your Pixel keeps getting better over time.', 809.00, 99, 7, 'Google', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Chip\":\"Google Tensor G3\",\"Display\":\"6.7\\\" Super Actua LTPO OLED (1-120Hz)\",\"RAM\":\"12GB LPDDR5X\",\"Camera\":\"50MP Wide | 48MP Ultra Wide | 48MP 5x Tele\",\"Battery\":\"5050 mAh (24+ hr battery)\",\"AI Features\":\"Magic Editor, Best Take, Audio Magic Eraser\",\"OS Updates\":\"7 Years\"}'),
(17, 'Samsung SSD 980 PRO M.2 PCIe NVMe 2TB', 'Next-level SSD performance. Unleash the power of the Samsung 980 PRO PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD.', 'The Samsung 980 PRO delivers next-level computing. Leveraging the PCIe 4.0 interface, the 980 PRO delivers double the data transfer rate of PCIe 3.0 while remaining backward compatible.\n\nWith read speeds up to 7,000 MB/s, you\'ll experience near-instant load times for gaming and heavy applications. The custom Elpis Controller and reliable thermal control ensure consistent high performance.\n\nDesigned for hardcore gamers and tech-savvy users, the 980 PRO offers high-performance bandwidth for heavy-duty applications.', 209.00, 98, 4, 'SAMSUNG', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Capacity\":\"2TB\",\"Form Factor\":\"M.2 2280\",\"Interface\":\"PCIe Gen 4.0 x4, NVMe 1.3c\",\"Seq Read\":\"Up to 7,000 MB/s\",\"Seq Write\":\"Up to 5,100 MB/s\",\"NAND\":\"Samsung V-NAND 3-bit MLC\",\"Cache\":\"2GB Low Power DDR4\"}'),
(18, 'iPhone 15', 'iPhone 15. Dynamic Island. New 48MP camera. USB-C. Durable color-infused glass.', 'The iPhone 15 features the Dynamic Island, which bubbles up alerts and Live Activities so you don\'t miss them. The new innovative design features back glass that has color infused throughout the material.\n\nThe Main camera is now 48MP, allowing you to take super-high-resolution photos. The 2x optical-quality Telephoto acts like a third camera.\n\nPowered by the A16 Bionic chip with a 5-core GPU, it handles advanced features like computational photography and smooth gaming transitions with ease.', 859.00, 100, 7, 'Apple', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Chip\":\"A16 Bionic\",\"Display\":\"6.1\\\" Super Retina XDR\",\"Camera\":\"48MP Main | 12MP Ultra Wide\",\"Feature\":\"Dynamic Island\",\"Connector\":\"USB-C\",\"Water Resistance\":\"IP68\",\"Safety\":\"Crash Detection\"}'),
(19, 'Lenovo ThinkPad E15', 'Lenovo ThinkPad E15. Reliability and performance for business professionals.', 'The Lenovo ThinkPad E15 Gen 4 is built for business. Powered by 12th Gen Intel Core processors, it\'s tough, secure, and portable.\n\nIt features a 15.6-inch FHD anti-glare display and Harman speakers with Dolby Audio for clear conference calls. The ThinkPad reliability means it\'s tested against 12 military-grade requirements.\n\nSecurity is paramount with the discrete TPM 2.0 chip to encrypt your data and a webcam privacy shutter.', 639.00, 100, 1, 'Lenovo', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Processor\":\"12th Gen Intel Core i5-1235U\",\"RAM\":\"16GB DDR4 3200MHz\",\"Storage\":\"512GB PCIe NVMe SSD\",\"Display\":\"15.6\\\" FHD (1920 x 1080) IPS\",\"Graphics\":\"Integrated Intel Iris Xe\",\"Security\":\"dTPM 2.0, Privacy Shutter\",\"Durability\":\"MIL-STD-810H Tested\"}'),
(20, 'Cooler Master Devastator 3 RGB', 'Cooler Master Devastator 3. The perfect gaming keyboard and mouse combo.', 'The Devastator 3 RGB Combo is the next generation of our popular gaming set. Featuring adjustable DPI up to 2400 and tactile keys for improved feedback, this is ideal for PC enthusiasts.\n\nThe keyboard features custom membrane switches that are durable and provide consistent tactile satisfaction. The mouse features an ergonomic low profile for comfort and a large high-precision mouse wheel.\n\nBoth peripherals feature 7-color LED backlighting to match your rig\'s theme.', 49.90, 100, 3, 'Cooler Master', '2025-12-17 22:25:17', '2025-12-19 22:53:35', 0, '{\"Keyboard Type\":\"Membrane (Custom Switches)\",\"Mouse DPI\":\"Adjustable (800 - 2400)\",\"Backlighting\":\"7-Color LED (Both)\",\"Media Keys\":\"Dedicated Multimedia Keys\",\"Mouse Sensor\":\"Optical\",\"Connectivity\":\"Wired (USB)\",\"Durability\":\"Laser-etched Grip Coated Keycaps\"}'),
(132, 'TP-Link Archer AX55', 'AX3000 Dual Band Gigabit Wi-Fi 6 Router with improved cooling and security.', 'Upgrade your network with the TP-Link Archer AX55. Featuring reduced latency and improved reliability, this router is perfect for 4K streaming and online gaming. \n        It supports OneMesh™ to create a flexible whole-home Wi-Fi with compatible extenders. The WPA3 security protocol provides enhanced protection for your personal password and data.', 129.99, 50, 6, 'TP-Link', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Wi-Fi Standard\":\"Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax)\",\"Speeds\":\"2402 Mbps (5GHz) + 574 Mbps (2.4GHz)\",\"Processor\":\"Dual-Core CPU\",\"Ethernet Ports\":\"1× Gigabit WAN, 4× Gigabit LAN\",\"USB Support\":\"1× USB 3.0 Port\",\"Features\":\"HomeShield, OneMesh, Alexa Compatible\"}'),
(133, 'Netgear Nighthawk RAX50', 'AX5400 6-Stream WiFi 6 Router with coverage up to 2,500 sq. ft.', 'Experience the future of WiFi with the Netgear Nighthawk RAX50. Engineered to deliver up to 4x more capacity for smart home devices compared to AC WiFi. \n        It features a 1.5GHz triple-core processor for smooth 4K/8K UHD streaming, AR/VR gaming, and video conferencing. NETGEAR Armor™ cybersecurity keeps your network safe.', 199.99, 40, 6, 'Netgear', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Wi-Fi Technology\":\"WiFi 6 (802.11ax) Dual Band\",\"Speed\":\"AX5400 (600 + 4800 Mbps)\",\"Processor\":\"1.5GHz Triple-Core\",\"Coverage\":\"Up to 2,500 sq. ft.\",\"Ports\":\"1 WAN + 4 LAN Gigabit Ethernet\",\"Security\":\"NETGEAR Armor, WPA3\"}'),
(134, 'Logitech C920 HD Pro Webcam', 'Full HD 1080p video calling and recording with stereo audio.', 'The Logitech C920 delivers remarkably crisp and detailed Full HD video (1080p at 30fps) with a full-glass lens, 78° field of view, and HD auto light correction. \n        Dual mics capture natural stereo sound. Perfect for streaming, conferencing, and content creation. Compatible with Windows, macOS, Chrome OS, and Android.', 69.99, 100, 8, 'Logitech', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Resolution\":\"1080p/30fps - 720p/60fps\",\"Focus\":\"Autofocus\",\"Lens\":\"Full HD Glass\",\"Field of View\":\"78°\",\"Microphone\":\"Built-in Stereo\",\"Connection\":\"USB-A (1.5 m cable)\",\"Mounting\":\"Tripod-ready universal clip\"}'),
(135, 'Premium Laptop Sleeve 15\"', 'Water-resistant, shockproof protective case for 15-15.6 inch laptops.', 'Keep your laptop safe with this durable, water-resistant sleeve. Features a soft, fluffy interior lining to prevent scratches and absorb shock. \n        The extra front pocket is spacious enough to keep mouse, earphones, pens, and notepads. Slim and lightweight design makes it easy to slide into your briefcase or backpack.', 29.99, 200, 8, 'Generic', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Compatibility\":\"15\\\" - 15.6\\\" Laptops\",\"Material\":\"Water-resistant Polyester\",\"Closure\":\"Top-loading Zipper\",\"Internal Dimensions\":\"15.35 x 10.63 x 0.8 inches\",\"Color\":\"Dark Grey\",\"Protection\":\"Shock absorption & scratch resistance\"}'),
(136, 'High-Speed HDMI 2.1 Cable', '48Gbps 8K Ultra High Speed Cable, 2 Meter / 6.6 Feet.', 'Fully compliant with HDMI 2.1 Specification. Supports 48Gbps bandwidth, 8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz, and Dynamic HDR. \n        Features gold-plated connectors, aluminum alloy shell, and durable nylon braided jacket. enhanced Audio Return Channel (eARC) simplifies connectivity and supports the most advanced audio formats.', 19.99, 300, 8, 'CableMod', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Type\":\"HDMI 2.1 Ultra High Speed\",\"Bandwidth\":\"48 Gbps\",\"Resolution Support\":\"8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz\",\"Length\":\"2m / 6.6ft\",\"Connectors\":\"Gold-Plated\",\"Features\":\"Dynamic HDR, eARC, VRR, QMS\",\"Durability\":\"Nylon Braided\"}'),
(137, 'LG UltraGear 27GN950-B', '27\" UHD 4K Nano IPS 1ms 144Hz HDR600 G-SYNC Compatible.', 'World’s first 4K Nano IPS 1ms (GtG) Gaming Monitor. Immerse yourself in the game with stunning visuals and speed. \n        VESA DisplayHDR 600 brings dynamic contrast and clarity to the battlefield. NVIDIA G-SYNC compatibility and AMD FreeSync Premium Pro minimize screen tearing and stutter. Sphere Lighting 2.0 syncs with your content.', 799.00, 25, 2, 'LG', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Screen Size\":\"27 Inch\",\"Panel Type\":\"Nano IPS\",\"Resolution\":\"3840 x 2160 (4K UHD)\",\"Refresh Rate\":\"144 Hz (Overclock 160 Hz)\",\"Response Time\":\"1ms (GtG)\",\"Color Gamut\":\"DCI-P3 98%\",\"HDR\":\"VESA DisplayHDR 600\",\"Connectivity\":\"2x HDMI 2.0, 1x DP 1.4, USB Hub\"}'),
(138, 'BenQ PD2700U DesignVue', '27 inch 4K UHD IPS Monitor 100% sRGB/Rec.709 HDR10.', 'Designed for designers. The BenQ PD2700U covers 100% of sRGB and Rec. 709 color spaces with factory-calibrated color accuracy (Delta E ≤ 3). \n        Features curated display modes like CAD/CAM, Animation, and Darkroom mode. DualView allows you to work in two modes side-by-side. KVM Switch allows you to control two PC systems from one set of keyboard and mouse.', 499.00, 30, 2, 'BenQ', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Screen Size\":\"27 Inch\",\"Panel Type\":\"IPS\",\"Resolution\":\"3840 x 2160 (4K UHD)\",\"Color Accuracy\":\"100% sRGB / Rec. 709\",\"Calibration\":\"Factory Calibrated (Delta E ≤ 3)\",\"Features\":\"KVM Switch, Daisy Chain, DualView\",\"Connectivity\":\"HDMI, DP, mDP, USB 3.0 Hub\"}'),
(139, 'Sony WH-1000XM5', 'Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones with Auto NC Optimizer.', 'The Sony WH-1000XM5 redefines distraction-free listening. Two processors control 8 microphones for unprecedented noise cancellation and exceptional call quality. \n        The newly developed driver unit delivers magnificent sound quality. The lightweight, rigid design with soft fit leather ensures comfort for long listening sessions. Offers up to 30 hours of battery life with quick charging.', 348.00, 60, 5, 'Sony', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Type\":\"Over-Ear Wireless\",\"Noise Cancellation\":\"Active (Pro/Auto NC Optimizer)\",\"Battery Life\":\"Up to 30 Hours (NC On)\",\"Charging\":\"USB-C (3 min charge = 3 hr playback)\",\"Audio\":\"High-Resolution Audio Wireless\",\"Features\":\"Speak-to-Chat, Multipoint connection\",\"Weight\":\"250g\"}'),
(140, 'Blue Yeti USB Microphone', 'Professional Multi-Pattern USB Mic for Recording and Streaming.', 'The Blue Yeti is the world’s #1 USB microphone. Its proprietary tri-capsule technology produces pristine, studio-quality recordings with legendary ease. \n        Four different pattern settings (Cardioid, Omni, Bidirectional, Stereo) offer incredible flexibility to record vocals, music, podcasts, audio for video, interviews, or lectures. Plug and play operation on Mac and PC.', 129.99, 80, 5, 'Blue', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Capsules\":\"3 Blue-proprietary 14mm condenser capsules\",\"Polar Patterns\":\"Cardioid, Bidirectional, Omnidirectional, Stereo\",\"Sample Rate\":\"48 kHz\",\"Bit Rate\":\"16-bit\",\"Frequency Response\":\"20Hz - 20kHz\",\"Connection\":\"USB (Mini-B)\",\"Monitoring\":\"Zero-latency headphone output\"}'),
(141, 'Keychron K2', '75% Layout Wireless Mechanical Keyboard for Mac & Windows.', 'The Keychron K2 is a super tactile wireless or wired mechanical keyboard giving you all the keys and functions you need while keeping it compact. \n        It features a 75% layout with 84 keys, retaining dedicated shortcut and arrow keys. Connects with up to 3 devices via Bluetooth 5.1 and switches among them easily. Contains a 4000mAh battery for long lasting use.', 79.00, 75, 3, 'Keychron', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', '2025-12-20 00:19:57', 0, '{\"Layout\":\"75% (84 Keys)\",\"Switch Type\":\"Gateron G Pro Mechanical (Red/Blue/Brown)\",\"Connectivity\":\"Bluetooth 5.1 / Wired USB-C\",\"Battery\":\"4000 mAh Li-polymer\",\"Compatibility\":\"Mac / Windows / Android / iOS\",\"Frame\":\"Aluminum / ABS\",\"Backlight\":\"RGB or White LED\"}');
